{"id":"531861035d8c6707","group":"29","path":"29/29-thm-colored-forest-c2.md","title":"C² 刻画有限无向彩色森林","display":"thm-colored-forest-c2 — C² 刻画有限无向彩色森林","type":"theorem","metadata":{"type":"theorem","book":"Descriptive Complexity (Neil Immerman)","book_abbrev":"29","label":"29-thm-colored-forest-c2","aliases":["29-thm-colored-forest-c2"],"display":"thm-colored-forest-c2 — C² 刻画有限无向彩色森林","depends_on":["[[29-df-graph-characterization]]","[[29-df-colored-graph]]","[[29-df-isomorphism]]","[[29-df-ck]]","[[29-df-vertex-refinement]]","[[29-thm-vertex-refinement-ck]]"],"source_locator":"Proposition 12.28 and Exercise 12.30, pp.191–192, DjVu scans 206–207","source_basis":"原书树命题的陈述及证明、彩色森林练习的题面已核对文本层；森林结论采用下述独立叶剥离与稳定分割论证，非原书完整证明","verification_status":"proved-in-note; source-statement-compared; external-complete-proof-not-available-for-exercise"},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"theorem"},{"key":"book","html":"Descriptive Complexity (Neil Immerman)"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"29"},{"key":"label","html":"29-thm-colored-forest-c2"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>29-thm-colored-forest-c2</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"thm-colored-forest-c2 — C² 刻画有限无向彩色森林"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"b961a724325c53e7\" href=\"?note=b961a724325c53e7\" title=\"29-df-graph-characterization\">29-df-graph-characterization</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"dd6d5729a326908a\" href=\"?note=dd6d5729a326908a\" title=\"29-df-colored-graph\">29-df-colored-graph</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"3a603dc4f41b07de\" href=\"?note=3a603dc4f41b07de\" title=\"29-df-isomorphism\">29-df-isomorphism</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"587fa3c5f12ce89b\" href=\"?note=587fa3c5f12ce89b\" title=\"29-df-ck\">29-df-ck</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"a4c575bb1780ff55\" href=\"?note=a4c575bb1780ff55\" title=\"29-df-vertex-refinement\">29-df-vertex-refinement</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"2985e9c09cdf49eb\" href=\"?note=2985e9c09cdf49eb\" title=\"29-thm-vertex-refinement-ck\">29-thm-vertex-refinement-ck</a></span></div>"},{"key":"source_locator","html":"Proposition 12.28 and Exercise 12.30, pp.191–192, DjVu scans 206–207"},{"key":"source_basis","html":"原书树命题的陈述及证明、彩色森林练习的题面已核对文本层；森林结论采用下述独立叶剥离与稳定分割论证，非原书完整证明"},{"key":"verification_status","html":"proved-in-note; source-statement-compared; external-complete-proof-not-available-for-exercise"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"r\\in\\mathbb N\">\\(r\\in\\mathbb N\\)</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{CGraph}_r\">\\(\\mathrm{CGraph}_r\\)</span> 为 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-7\" data-note=\"dd6d5729a326908a\" href=\"?note=dd6d5729a326908a\" title=\"29-df-colored-graph\">29-df-colored-graph</a> 的非空有限无向简单彩色图类，颜色谓词可以重叠。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"G,H\\in\\mathrm{CGraph}_r\">\\(G,H\\in\\mathrm{CGraph}_r\\)</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf C_2\">\\(\\mathsf C_2\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\equiv_{\\mathsf C_2,r}\">\\(\\equiv_{\\mathsf C_2,r}\\)</span> 和 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{CharClass}\">\\(\\operatorname{CharClass}\\)</span> 取 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-8\" data-note=\"b961a724325c53e7\" href=\"?note=b961a724325c53e7\" title=\"29-df-graph-characterization\">29-df-graph-characterization</a>。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Forest}(G)\">\\(\\operatorname{Forest}(G)\\)</span> 及 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Forest}_r\">\\(\\mathrm{Forest}_r\\)</span> 由下式引入；环至少有三个互异顶点。不为森林选根，不添加顶点序，也不限制比较图 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"H\">\\(H\\)</span> 为森林。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Forest}(G)\\ \\Longleftrightarrow\\ \\forall m\\in\\mathbb N_{\\geq3}\\;\\forall(v_1,\\ldots,v_m)\\in|G|^m\\;\n\\left(\\bigwedge_{1\\leq i&lt;j\\leq m}v_i\\ne v_j\\to\\neg\\left(E^G(v_m,v_1)\\land\\bigwedge_{i=1}^{m-1}E^G(v_i,v_{i+1})\\right)\\right).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{Forest}(G)\\ \\Longleftrightarrow\\ \\forall m\\in\\mathbb N_{\\geq3}\\;\\forall(v_1,\\ldots,v_m)\\in|G|^m\\;\n\\left(\\bigwedge_{1\\leq i&lt;j\\leq m}v_i\\ne v_j\\to\\neg\\left(E^G(v_m,v_1)\\land\\bigwedge_{i=1}^{m-1}E^G(v_i,v_{i+1})\\right)\\right).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Forest}_r\\coloneqq\\{G\\in\\mathrm{CGraph}_r\\mid\\operatorname{Forest}(G)\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{Forest}_r\\coloneqq\\{G\\in\\mathrm{CGraph}_r\\mid\\operatorname{Forest}(G)\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"G\\in\\mathrm{Forest}_r\\land G\\equiv_{\\mathsf C_2,r}H\\ \\Longrightarrow\\ G\\cong H.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[G\\in\\mathrm{Forest}_r\\land G\\equiv_{\\mathsf C_2,r}H\\ \\Longrightarrow\\ G\\cong H.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{CharClass}_{\\mathsf C_2,r}(\\mathrm{Forest}_r).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{CharClass}_{\\mathsf C_2,r}(\\mathrm{Forest}_r).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>原书 Proposition 12.28，印刷页191、扫描页206，给出树的结论及自底向上的同构证明；Exercise 12.30，印刷页192、扫描页207，要求推广到无向彩色森林，题面没有完整证明。本条只取该练习的无向部分，并给出如下本地论证。取 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"G,H\">\\(G,H\\)</span> 的不交并作为共同颜色细化背景；各轮颜色的特征式由初始颜色真值组合、邻接关系与对上一轮颜色的精确计数构成，只用两个变量。因为这些特征式的量词只检查邻居，它们在不交并与各自分量中的真值一致。两图 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"C^2\">\\(C^2\\)</span> 句子等价，迫使每轮每一颜色类在两图中的顶点数相等；有限性使共同分割最终稳定，稳定类的数量也相等。</p>\n<p>先说明比较图也无环。令 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"P_0(x)\">\\(P_0(x)\\)</span> 为恒真式，递归令 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"P_{t+1}(x)\">\\(P_{t+1}(x)\\)</span> 表示 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"P_t(x)\">\\(P_t(x)\\)</span> 且至少有两个满足 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"P_t\">\\(P_t\\)</span> 的邻居。该式可轮换两个变量名写成 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"C^2\">\\(C^2\\)</span> 公式。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"P_t\">\\(P_t\\)</span> 描述同时反复删除度至多一顶点后仍存活的顶点。有限森林 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"G\">\\(G\\)</span> 至多 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{card}(|G|)\">\\(\\operatorname{card}(|G|)\\)</span> 轮全部删除；于是句子“存在满足 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"P_{\\operatorname{card}(|G|)}\">\\(P_{\\operatorname{card}(|G|)}\\)</span> 的顶点”在 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"G,H\">\\(G,H\\)</span> 中均为假。任何环上的全部顶点每轮都保留，所以 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"H\">\\(H\\)</span> 无环。</p>\n<p>在一个有限森林中，记录各顶点被删除的轮次；同一稳定颜色的顶点有相同删除轮次，因为存活条件完全由各稳定类的邻居数决定。每个顶点除较早删除的邻居外至多还连一个尚存活的邻居。将较早删除的邻居看作子节点，由删除轮次归纳：顶点的稳定颜色确定其一元颜色真值组合，以及每种子树类型的子节点数，因此确定其朝外分支的彩色根树同构类型。每个连通分量最后剩一个中心顶点或一条中心边；中心类型由较早分支的类型决定，中心边的类型由两端分支类型的无序对决定。中心和中心边端点在各稳定类中的归属、伙伴颜色及计数，都由同一稳定分割及其邻居计数确定。因此两图有相同数目的每一种彩色树分量，逐分量拼接同构，得到 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"G\\cong H\">\\(G\\cong H\\)</span>。孤立顶点属于单中心分量，亦被计数；单边分量属于双中心分量。</p>\n<p>最后，任何有限着色扩张只增加一元谓词并保持原边关系，故仍是无向彩色森林。对任意扩张词汇重新应用上一结论，得到 Definition 12.3 所要求的全部着色扩张刻画，而不仅是原始颜色下的区分。此证明未作为有向森林或无限森林的证明；未进行机器证明核验。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"29-df-graph-characterization","status":"resolved","id":"b961a724325c53e7","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[29-df-graph-characterization]]","embed":false},{"target":"29-df-colored-graph","status":"resolved","id":"dd6d5729a326908a","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[29-df-colored-graph]]","embed":false},{"target":"29-df-isomorphism","status":"resolved","id":"3a603dc4f41b07de","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[29-df-isomorphism]]","embed":false},{"target":"29-df-ck","status":"resolved","id":"587fa3c5f12ce89b","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[29-df-ck]]","embed":false},{"target":"29-df-vertex-refinement","status":"resolved","id":"a4c575bb1780ff55","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[29-df-vertex-refinement]]","embed":false},{"target":"29-thm-vertex-refinement-ck","status":"resolved","id":"2985e9c09cdf49eb","anchor":"ref-6","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[29-thm-vertex-refinement-ck]]","embed":false},{"target":"29-df-colored-graph","status":"resolved","id":"dd6d5729a326908a","anchor":"ref-7","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$r\\in\\mathbb N$；$\\mathrm{CGraph}_r$ 为 [[29-df-colored-graph]] 的非空有限无向简单彩色图类，颜色谓词可以重叠。","embed":false},{"target":"29-df-graph-characterization","status":"resolved","id":"b961a724325c53e7","anchor":"ref-8","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$G,H\\in\\mathrm{CGraph}_r$；$\\mathsf C_2$、$\\equiv_{\\mathsf C_2,r}$ 和 $\\operatorname{CharClass}$ 取 [[29-df-graph-characterization]]。","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"r\\in\\mathbb N","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{CGraph}_r","display":false},{"tex":"G,H\\in\\mathrm{CGraph}_r","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathsf C_2","display":false},{"tex":"\\equiv_{\\mathsf C_2,r}","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{CharClass}","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{Forest}(G)","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Forest}_r","display":false},{"tex":"H","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{Forest}(G)\\ \\Longleftrightarrow\\ \\forall m\\in\\mathbb N_{\\geq3}\\;\\forall(v_1,\\ldots,v_m)\\in|G|^m\\;\n\\left(\\bigwedge_{1\\leq i<j\\leq m}v_i\\ne v_j\\to\\neg\\left(E^G(v_m,v_1)\\land\\bigwedge_{i=1}^{m-1}E^G(v_i,v_{i+1})\\right)\\right).","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Forest}_r\\coloneqq\\{G\\in\\mathrm{CGraph}_r\\mid\\operatorname{Forest}(G)\\}.","display":true},{"tex":"G\\in\\mathrm{Forest}_r\\land G\\equiv_{\\mathsf C_2,r}H\\ \\Longrightarrow\\ G\\cong H.","display":true},{"tex":"\\operatorname{CharClass}_{\\mathsf C_2,r}(\\mathrm{Forest}_r).","display":true},{"tex":"G,H","display":false},{"tex":"C^2","display":false},{"tex":"P_0(x)","display":false},{"tex":"P_{t+1}(x)","display":false},{"tex":"P_t(x)","display":false},{"tex":"P_t","display":false},{"tex":"C^2","display":false},{"tex":"P_t","display":false},{"tex":"G","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{card}(|G|)","display":false},{"tex":"P_{\\operatorname{card}(|G|)}","display":false},{"tex":"G,H","display":false},{"tex":"H","display":false},{"tex":"G\\cong H","display":false}],"bytes":4410,"backlinks":[{"id":"38909ffa6d1e85ce","anchor":"ref-149","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[29-df-graph-characterization]]、[[29-thm-colored-forest-c2]] — 全部有限着色扩张下的图刻画与彩色森林"},{"id":"ecc0dd131d213345","anchor":"ref-172","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[../29-thm-colored-forest-c2]]"}],"outgoing":["b961a724325c53e7","dd6d5729a326908a","3a603dc4f41b07de","587fa3c5f12ce89b","a4c575bb1780ff55","2985e9c09cdf49eb"]}